  "reflectionText": "Six times God looked at what he had made, and the text says he saw that it was good. The seventh time, after the man and the woman, the word changed — very good. What is it to notice that the making is swift, but the seeing is deliberate — that joy lives in the moment between the work of a day and the choice to stop and see what it has given?",
